798
01:03:45,635 --> 01:03:48,628
And the Muslims, these Muslims; these simple Muslims,

799
01:03:49,535 --> 01:03:51,800
they have love of Rasool Ullah ﷺ in their heart.

800
01:03:51,840 --> 01:03:52,531
This is their fitrah(فطره).

801
01:03:52,551 --> 01:03:56,337
They're not scholars, but they're Muslims who love Rasool Ullah ﷺ.

802
01:03:56,557 --> 01:03:58,897
They naturally came out to the streets to demonstrate.

803
01:03:58,950 --> 01:04:04,263
Now we might disagree, we might agree with this demonstration thing or disagree,

804
01:04:04,383 --> 01:04:10,178
