805
01:04:10,362 --> 01:04:14,532
But the thing is, we know we need to look at the spirit that drove the Muslims to the street.

806
01:04:14,575 --> 01:04:16,938
It is their fitrah(فطره), their love of Rasool Ullah ﷺ.

807
01:04:17,688 --> 01:04:19,994
And they burned flags, and they did this and that.

808
01:04:20,048 --> 01:04:25,030
Now Subhan-Allah(سبحان الله) the Ulama(علماء) rather than coming out

809
01:04:25,110 --> 01:04:27,330
some of these scholars, rather than coming out,

810
01:04:28,270 --> 01:04:33,439
and clarifying to the masses the responsibility and the Hukkam(حكم) of Sharia(شريعه) and this,

811
01:04:33,705 --> 01:04:34,759
as Allahعزَوجلَ says;

812
01:04:34,799 --> 01:04:36,981
لَتُبَيِّنُنَّهُ لِلنَّاسِ وَلاَ تَكْتُمُونَهُ

813
01:04:37,155 --> 01:04:41,688
that the role of the Scholars is to clarify things for the people and not to hide it.

814
01:04:41,915 --> 01:04:45,534
They did not clarify the things, they in fact, confuse the people,

815
01:04:46,474 --> 01:04:50,914
rather than tell them what the Hukkam(حكم) of Allah is, they condemned them for demonstration.

816
01:04:51,014 --> 01:04:52,784
They condemned them for burning flags.

817
01:04:52,967 --> 01:04:55,215
They condemned them for going out in the streets,

818
01:04:55,295 --> 01:05:00,912
and some of them went as far as condemning them for boycotting Danish products,

819
01:05:01,295 --> 01:05:05,876
