820
01:05:05,943 --> 01:05:11,362
and we need to build the bridges and bridge the gaps and all of that nonsense.

821
01:05:12,288 --> 01:05:14,189
Where is the Hukkam(حكم) of Allah عزَوجلَ?

822
01:05:14,242 --> 01:05:18,440
How come it was not clarified, if you cannot speak the truth, then stay quiet.

823
01:05:18,594 --> 01:05:21,800
مَن كان يؤمن بالله واليوم الآخر فليقل خيرًا أو ليصمت

824
01:05:22,020 --> 01:05:29,012
Whoever believes in Allah and the Last day, should either speak the truth and say good or stay quiet?

825
01:05:30,185 --> 01:05:34,611
You have these people who are wearing the cloak of scholarship,

826
01:05:35,465 --> 01:05:40,596
and they are deceiving the people and telling them that they shouldn't do this and they shouldn't do that,

827
01:05:40,736 --> 01:05:44,263
and they're condemning what the people did.

828
