What did they do?

829
01:05:45,023 --> 01:05:48,265
The people went out to demonstrate and they wanted to boycott Danish products.

830
01:05:48,356 --> 01:05:54,048
I mean, these are things that are more befitting of followers of Gandhi than followers of Muhammad(ﷺ).

831
01:05:54,115 --> 01:05:54,415
Who said;

832
01:05:54,435 --> 01:05:57,515
انا نبي الرحمة وانا نبي الملحمة

833
01:05:57,568 --> 01:06:01,620
I am the Prophet of mercy, and I am the Prophet of war.

834
01:06:01,855 --> 01:06:03,441
Muhammad(ﷺ), who said;

835
01:06:03,721 --> 01:06:05,775
بعثت بالسيف بين يدي الساعة

836
01:06:05,808 --> 01:06:08,551
I was sent with the sword before the day of judgment,

837
01:06:08,571 --> 01:06:10,005
حتى يُعبدَ اللهُ وحدَه

838
01:06:10,078 --> 01:06:11,667
Until Allah is worshiped alone.

839
01:06:12,231 --> 01:06:13,745
أُمرتُ أن أُقاتل الناسَ

840
01:06:13,878 --> 01:06:15,427
I was instructed to fight the people,

841
01:06:15,641 --> 01:06:19,725
and he told the people of Quraish(قريش ) to commit them, I came to you with slaughter.

842
01:06:19,941 --> 01:06:24,673
We are followers of Muhammad ﷺ were not followers of Gandhi, we should know who we are,

843
01:06:24,890 --> 01:06:28,029
and we should know who are we dealing ,with we're dealing with Rasool Ullah ﷺ.

844
01:06:28,162 --> 01:06:30,029
This is blasphemy against Rasool Ullah.

845
01:06:30,216 --> 01:06:31,702
And then things got worse.

846
01:06:31,969 --> 01:06:42,187
You have this evil thing of a human being this Swedish guy, Lars vils, who drew Muhammad ﷺ, Astagfirullah(استغفرالله العظيم).

847
01:06:42,234 --> 01:06:44,294
And it's even difficult for him to speak these words.

848
01:06:44,414 --> 01:06:47,591
He drew Muhammad ﷺ, in the form of a dog.

849
01:06:47,694 --> 01:06:54,345
And then you have these scoundrels coming out giving a Fatwa(فتوى) to condemn those who threatened him,

850
01:06:54,812 --> 01:07:01,248
rather than speak out against this kufr(كفر), and rather than show the people what the Hukkam(حكم) of Sharia(شريعه) is,

851
01:07:01,268 --> 01:07:03,467
you only come out to condemn Muslims.

852
01:07:04,121 --> 01:07:11,300
Where is fulfilling the role of Elm(علم) one should either fulfill that role and speak the truth and speak the Haq

853
01:07:11,385 --> 01:07:15,298
or take out that clock of scholarship and stay at home.

854
01:07:16,038 --> 01:07:22,336
We are dealing with Rasool Ullah ﷺ, Muhammad Bin Muslimah(محمدبن مسلمه) told the people, when you see me, grab his head,

855
01:07:22,516 --> 01:07:24,153
tear him apart with your swords.

856
01:07:24,469 --> 01:07:28,963
That is what Muhammad Bin Muslimah(محمدبن مسلمه) did, but we have now Muhammad Bin Muslimah(محمدبن مسلمه) today.

857
01:07:29,949 --> 01:07:38,882
Rasool Ullah ﷺ is to be defended by ourselves and by our wealth and by everything that we own.

858
01:07:38,922 --> 01:07:46,031
This is our duty towards the Messenger of Allah صلوات اللہ وسلام علیہ, and we want to say, just like what Al-Qazi Ayyaz(القاضى عياض) said;

859
01:07:46,278 --> 01:07:53,878
We have no clue who these scholars are, and we would give the same words that Al-Qazi Ayyaz(القاضى عياض) said;

860
01:07:53,951 --> 01:08:00,654
 Probably they are not known for having Elm(علم); or we cannot trust their Fatwa(فتوى), or they are people who follow their desires.

861
01:08:01,146 --> 01:08:02,346
Ibn Taymiyyah(ابن تيميه) said;

862
01:08:03,046 --> 01:08:12,934
وهذاالفعل ھو نوم من الجهادوالاغلاب على الكافرين والمنافقين واظهاردين الله عزّوجلّ والى كلمةومعلوم انّ هذا واجب

863
01:08:13,181 --> 01:08:23,047
 فعلم انّ قتل السّاب واجب فى الجمله وحيث جا ذالعفو له فانّما هو فى من كان مقدورا عليه

864
01:08:23,307 --> 01:08:29,446
He said; It is Wajib(واجب); it is mandatory; to kill the one who curses the Rasool Ullah ﷺ.

865
01:08:29,760 --> 01:08:36,483
And he said; If there's any examples otherwise in Seerah(سيره); it is because they have come to him,

866
01:08:36,643 --> 01:08:39,436
and they have announced their Toba(توبه), and they have become Muslim.

867
01:08:39,623 --> 01:08:42,286
But if they don't, then the Hukkam(حكم) remains.

868
01:08:43,419 --> 01:08:44,259
And he said;

869
01:08:44,726 --> 01:08:51,539
فيعلم العاقل أن سب رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم جناية لها موقع يزيد على عامة الجنايات

870
01:08:51,912 --> 01:08:56,423
He said; Cursing Rasool Ullah ﷺ is a crime, that is greater than other crimes.

871
01:08:56,729 --> 01:09:00,759
بحيث يستحق صاحبها من العقوبة مالا يستحقه غيره

872
01:09:00,926 --> 01:09:04,609
And that is why the punishment is more than other crimes.

873
01:09:04,946 --> 01:09:09,309
وإن كان كافراً حربياً مبالغاً في محاربة المسلمين ،

874
01:09:09,462 --> 01:09:14,071
وأن وجوب الانتصار ممن كان هذا حاله كان مؤكداً في الدين

875
01:09:14,704 --> 01:09:22,577
And if such a person is a Kafir(كافر) who is fighting the Muslims, then it is mandatory to give victory for Rasool Ullah ﷺ.

876
01:09:22,890 --> 01:09:25,374
والسعي في إهدار دمه من أفضل الأعمال

877
01:09:25,517 --> 01:09:29,663
And seeking to spill his blood is one of the greatest deeds.

878
01:09:29,896 --> 01:09:30,783
وأوجبها

879
01:09:30,949 --> 01:09:33,443
And one of the most mandatory deeds.

880
01:09:33,536 --> 01:09:34,839
وأحقها بالمسارعة

881
01:09:34,999 --> 01:09:37,445
And it is a deed that one should hasten towards.

882
01:09:37,726 --> 01:09:43,879
وابتغاء رضوان الله تعالى فيه ، وأبلغ الجهاد الذي كتبه الله على عباده وفرضه عليهم

883
01:09:44,006 --> 01:09:47,046
That is one of the greatest forms of Jihad Fee Sabil Lillah(جهادفى سبيل الله).

884
01:09:47,826 --> 01:09:49,065
These are the words of Ibn Taymiyyah(ابن تيميه).

885
01:09:49,311 --> 01:09:50,758
These are the words of our scholars.

886
01:09:51,998 --> 01:09:59,549
Now, some of the arguments that are presented is that Rasool Ullah ﷺ, when the Jews came to him, and said Assaam o Alaykum(السام عليكم ),

887
01:09:59,983 --> 01:10:03,108
rather than saying Assalam o Alaykum(السلام عليكم ); they said Assam o Alaykum(السّام عليكم).

888
01:10:03,388 --> 01:10:05,781
Which means may death befall you.

889
01:10:06,062 --> 01:10:12,863
Ayesha(عائشه), she cursed them, and that Rasool Ullah ﷺ told her that Allahعزَوجلَ loves leniency,

890
01:10:13,237 --> 01:10:15,049
ان الله يحب الرفق في كل شيء

891
01:10:15,484 --> 01:10:17,583
And he told her not to curse them.

892
01:10:17,856 --> 01:10:20,690
So they say this is how we should deal with these people.

893
01:10:21,670 --> 01:10:30,961
This argument, Ibn Taymiyyah(ابن تيميه) and Al-Qazi Ayyaz(القاضى عياض)  did not leave it, without responding to and refuting.

894
01:10:31,347 --> 01:10:32,547
Al-Qazi Ayyaz(القاضى عياض) said;

895
01:10:33,334 --> 01:10:37,656
This hadith(حديث) and others similar to it, were in the beginning of Islam.

896
01:10:38,122 --> 01:10:43,419
But after that, the Hukkam(حكم) of Sharia(شريعه) is that; they should not be forgiven.

897
01:10:43,696 --> 01:10:46,814
So he said; this is the Hukkam(حكم) that is Mansukh(منسوخ) it's abrogated.

898
01:10:47,330 --> 01:10:58,443
Ibn Taymiyyah(ابن تيميه) says; Number one, this is not a outwardly clear cursing of Rasool Ullah ﷺ,

899
01:10:58,623 --> 01:11:03,427
because it was something that's not apparent for anyone, or is not apparent for everyone.

900
01:11:03,929 --> 01:11:09,567
And then he also says; that Rasool Ullah ﷺ can forgive, but we cannot.

901
01:11:10,598 --> 01:11:13,148
Rasool Ullah ﷺ, this is Haqq(حق) for him.

902
01:11:13,543 --> 01:11:23,030
It is something that belongs to Him; to forgive or not to forgive, because it is a harm done to him.

903
01:11:23,236 --> 01:11:26,829
So he has the right to forgive, but we don't have that right.

904
01:11:27,609 --> 01:11:32,269
It is a Haqq(حق) of Rasool Ullah ﷺ, and therefore he is the one who can forgive.

905
01:11:32,322 --> 01:11:39,064
For example, somebody takes money from me, he steals money from me, and then you forgive him.

906
01:11:39,251 --> 01:11:40,257
It's not of your business.

907
01:11:40,477 --> 01:11:41,884
How could you forgive him?

908
01:11:41,991 --> 01:11:43,682
I'm the one who need to forgive him.

909
01:11:44,151 --> 01:11:46,664
So it is up to Rasool Ullah ﷺ to forgive or not.

910
01:11:46,844 --> 01:11:52,197
Ibn Taymiyyah(ابن تيميه) says; After Rasool Ullah ﷺ passed away, we cannot forgive anyone.

911
01:11:52,817 --> 01:11:59,156
We can forgive people when they harm us, but not when they harm Rasool Ullah ﷺ.

912
01:12:00,689 --> 01:12:08,352
Another argument; is that the Kuffar(كفّار) they curse Allahعزَوجلَ, and they say that Allah has a son, when they talk about Eesa(عیسی).

913
01:12:08,898 --> 01:12:11,118
So that is something greater.

914
01:12:11,452 --> 01:12:12,432
Ibn Taymiyyah(ابن تيميه) says;

915
01:12:13,005 --> 01:12:18,080
When they say that about Allah, they don't really mean that they want to curse Allah.

916
01:12:18,467 --> 01:12:22,183
It is their belief, and they honestly believe in that.

917
01:12:22,369 --> 01:12:25,803
And when they say that they don't intend to curse.

918
01:12:26,796 --> 01:12:34,468
But when they speak about Rasool Ullah ﷺ, they're intending to harm the Muslims, and they're intending to speak against Islam.

919
01:12:34,628 --> 01:12:36,199
And therefore the two are different.

920
01:12:37,079 --> 01:12:40,592
A few points to close with.

921
01:12:41,459 --> 01:12:48,032
Number one, the defamation of Muhammad ﷺ will not harm him.

922
01:12:48,892 --> 01:12:49,996
It doesn't harm him.

923
01:12:51,436 --> 01:13:00,152
Rasool Ullah ﷺ is one honored and his name is Muhammad(محمّد), the most praised one, at every single moment of the day around the globe.

924
01:13:00,185 --> 01:13:05,378
In every different time zone, there is a minerate that is calling to Adhan(اذان) and saying;

925
01:13:05,398 --> 01:13:07,271
اشهدانّ محمّدارسول الله

926
01:13:08,638 --> 01:13:12,920
And there are angels that are saying صلى الله علي سیدنا محمد.

927
01:13:13,238 --> 01:13:16,225
And Allahعزَوجلَ is making salah(صلاه), on Muhammad ﷺ.

928
01:13:16,865 --> 01:13:19,201
انّ الله وملائكته يصلّون على النّبى

929
01:13:19,894 --> 01:13:24,984
And there are believers all over the world who are making Salah(صلاه) on Rasool Ullah ﷺ.

930
01:13:25,330 --> 01:13:33,797
So what these villains would say against Rasool Ullah ﷺ would not harm him, but it is a harm of us.

931
01:13:34,517 --> 01:13:42,365
It is the sin on our behalf, to allow the defamation of Muhammad ﷺ to happen.

932
01:13:43,859 --> 01:13:45,193
So we are the ones who are harmed.

933
01:13:45,240 --> 01:13:50,268
We are the ones who should be concerned, not Muhammad ﷺ, this doesn't harm Muhammad ﷺ.

934
01:13:52,195 --> 01:14:02,330
The second thing, even though this thing angers us, it is a sign, that the defeat of the Kuffar(كفّار) is near,

935
01:14:03,610 --> 01:14:04,921
because Ibn Taymiyyah(ابن تيميه) says;

936
01:14:05,667 --> 01:14:15,966
Many Muslims trust worthy people of expertise and Fiqh(فقہ) spoke many times about their experiences

937
01:14:16,833 --> 01:14:21,598
when they would surround castles and cities in Hasham(الشّام),

938
01:14:22,665 --> 01:14:32,191
when they would surround the Christians, they said; We would surround the castle or the city for a month or more,

939
01:14:32,844 --> 01:14:38,554
and our Besiege is doing nothing, and our besieging of them is doing nothing.

940
01:14:39,214 --> 01:14:42,730
And we are almost going to give up and leave.

941
01:14:43,394 --> 01:14:54,802
And then when the people of that town or castle, fortress start cursing Rasool Ullah ﷺ, suddenly it falls in our hands.

942
01:14:55,249 --> 01:15:02,300
And sometimes the delay wouldn't be even a day or two, and then it would be opened by force.

943
01:15:03,334 --> 01:15:07,206
He said; So we would take it as a glad tiding

944
01:15:07,246 --> 01:15:12,339
when we would hear them curse Rasool Ullah ﷺ, even though our hearts would be filled with hatred,

945
01:15:13,013 --> 01:15:17,355
but we would see it as a glad tiding because it's a sign of our coming victory.

946
01:15:17,682 --> 01:15:21,154
And that is the meaning of the Ayah(آية) of Surat Al-Kausar(سورة الكوثر);

947
01:15:21,362 --> 01:15:23,211
ان شانئك هو الابتر

948
01:15:23,333 --> 01:15:26,057
Indeed your enemy is the one, who is cut off.

949
01:15:26,473 --> 01:15:30,143
So Allahعزَوجلَ will cut off the enemies of Muhammad ﷺ,

950
01:15:30,763 --> 01:15:38,947
and this affair that is happening now is one of the worst events, or incidents of cursing Muhammad ﷺ.

951
01:15:39,180 --> 01:15:41,570
In fact, it might be the worst in our history,

952
01:15:42,247 --> 01:15:45,579
because it started out with one newspaper in Denmark,

953
01:15:45,966 --> 01:15:52,282
and then many governments and many newspapers around the world showed their solidarity.

954
01:15:53,255 --> 01:15:56,392
Under the pretext of freedom of speech,

955
01:15:56,439 --> 01:16:01,016
they showed their solidarity, and the cartoons went all over the world,

956
01:16:01,916 --> 01:16:05,836
and then you had the incident of this Swedish cartoons,

957
01:16:05,969 --> 01:16:13,262
which depicted Muhammad ﷺ in the worst and it is one of the worst forms of cursing that we have ever heard of.

958
01:16:14,302 --> 01:16:19,023
And then you now have the abuse of the book of Allahعزَوجلَ in ways that we have never heard of,

959
01:16:19,576 --> 01:16:26,722
using it as toilet paper and target and shooting at the book of Allahعزَوجلَ for target practice.

960
01:16:27,175 --> 01:16:36,677
So what is happening now and the enormous extent of it, even though it angers every Muslim,

961
01:16:36,697 --> 01:16:41,729
but it should also be a sign that the end of this Kuffar(كفر) is near.

962
01:16:42,569 --> 01:16:50,735
Last point, brothers and sisters! we as a Ummah(امّه), as Muslims, should never forget,

963
01:16:51,695 --> 01:16:58,594
during the crusade, the sixth crusade against the Muslims,

964
01:16:59,187 --> 01:17:03,890
when they attacked the town of Dmiat in Egypt in year 615,

965
01:17:05,223 --> 01:17:12,040
and after the Crusaders, they occupied Demyat.

966
01:17:12,586 --> 01:17:15,286
The Ayyubi Amir(ایوبی امیر) Muhammad Al-Kamil(محمّد الكامل).

967
01:17:15,720 --> 01:17:17,698
He was in Mansoorah(منصورۃ) fighting them.

968
01:17:17,998 --> 01:17:22,171
It is said that there was one of these men from the Crusaders,

969
01:17:22,364 --> 01:17:29,457
who used to come out every day and curse Muhammad saw him with the worst words, and he would do that on a daily basis.

970
01:17:29,690 --> 01:17:37,787
And the Ameer(امیر) of the Muslims Muhammad Al-Kamil(محمّد الكامل) would just wish if he could get his hands on this man and capture him.

971
01:17:38,220 --> 01:17:42,516
And he engraved his face in his memory.

972
01:17:43,762 --> 01:17:48,775
And this is year 615, three years later, the crusade failed, and they left.

973
01:17:49,075 --> 01:17:54,515
But this particular man, he went on to carry on the fight to Hasham(الشّام).

974
01:17:55,008 --> 01:17:59,945
And Subhan-Allah(سبحان الله); He fell into custody of the Muslims,

975
01:18:00,342 --> 01:18:03,245
and Al Amir Muhammad Al-Kamil(محمّد الكامل) remembered him.

976
01:18:04,392 --> 01:18:07,624
And we're talking about year 625, ten years later.

977
01:18:07,845 --> 01:18:14,278
So he takes him away, and he sends him to Madinah(مدينه) and gives command to the Emir of Madinah(مدينه)

978
01:18:14,298 --> 01:18:19,327
to slaughter him in front of the grave of Muhammad ﷺ on the day of Jumah(جمعه).

979
01:18:20,134 --> 01:18:22,581
Ten years later and he did not forget.

980
01:18:23,207 --> 01:18:29,254
So, brothers and sisters! We ask Allahعزَوجل, that he raises among us, men and women,

981
01:18:29,987 --> 01:18:31,267
that, as Allah says;

982
01:18:31,327 --> 01:18:33,178
لا يخافون في الله لومة لائم

983
01:18:33,198 --> 01:18:37,411
They do not fear in the sake of Allah the blame of the blamers,

984
01:18:37,985 --> 01:18:45,070
who would make the Kuffar(كفّار) realize that they, by committing blasphemy against our beloved Muhammad(محمّد),

985
01:18:45,263 --> 01:18:51,980
have actually walked straight into a hornet's nest, and that the dust of this will never settle down.

986
01:18:52,859 --> 01:18:55,659
اقولو قولی ھذا واستغفرللہ العظیم ولی ولکم

987
01:18:55,779 --> 01:18:58,150
فستغفرہ انہ ھوالغفور الرحیم

988
01:18:58,296 --> 01:19:02,981
وصلی اللہ علی سیدنا محمد وعلی آلہ وصحبہ وسلم

989
01:19:03,207 --> 01:19:06,180
والسلام و علیکم ورحمۃ اللہ وبرکاتہ

